Z||000006||FieroMike||06-04-99||09:21 AM||||Thanks guys!! I was beginning to wonder what you did with your Fiero's out on the road! :-)<p>Cliff: Must be nice...<p>87GT: Good kill, it's always nice to spank the foreign cars!  Have you lined up against the new '99 Civic SI? They are fast!<p>Eric: I would like to autocross someday, it looks like a lot of fun.  I don't know about not getting 260hp :-), if I can't get mine up that high then on goes a turbo charger or NOS!<p>Racer 1: You have the 4?  I had one for 2 years, I couldn't even beat the Civics, that's why I got pissed and bought the 6!  I have raced Preludes,Accord's (v-6),Civics, Integras, and have had no problem.  The only one that beat me was a turbocharged Honda Accord v-6, it was pretty fast. I will beat it soon though, oh yes, I will beat it! :-)<p>Pretender: (and all) I have a good limit story for you.<p>I had just got my v-6 the day before and was coming down Arapahoe road towards I-25 our main highway here in Colorado.  There was a '98 Mustang Cobra that had just pulled out onto the street and I don't like Mustangs so I got on it real quick and pulled in front of him. (He wasn't racing obviously)  So that pissed him off and he changed lanes and got up next to me.  I was in the far right and he was 1 left to me.  So I laugh at him for having a Mustang and he laughs at me bcz I have a Fiero and he pulls in front of me.  So we are nearing the exchange that clover-leafs around to get on the highway.  So I drop it into 2nd get next to him and get on it.  So does he, suprisingly by the end of second he was only 3/4 ahead of me, and I put it in 3rd and start pulling to 80 and so does he and then we hit the cloverleaf!!!  Hah!  He slowed to about 50mph and it looked like that hunk of junk was gonna tip over!! I kept accelerating through turn and ended up about 15 cars ahead of him on the highway and bcz of traffic he could never catch up! What a loser! :-) I bet he was pissed.<p>Happy hunting all!!! (Sorry so Long)
