Z||000021||Yellow85||06-07-99||12:36 PM||||First model of Laser is 89(I believe).<br>1st gen. Talon is fast as newer one because they use bigger turbine in addition, most of driver use vvc or etc. to maximize their power. one thing i know is that DMS 4wd is fast till 2nd gear but not after 3rd(if there is no mod). When i had 92Plerude(non-Vtec)i never lost DMS(with fuctory turbine)on High way(2 of my friends drive them).But since i got my 85GT, I never race with them. Anyway, any of you guys ever raced with NSX before? My dream is that to beat NSX with my fiero(some day in the future).<p>My 85GT VS _________<p>VS Civic si --Won<br>VS Integra(non-Vetec)--Won<br>VS GSR -- Won 2times Lost once<br>VS Type-R -- Never Won<br>VS 97&up Plerude(SH)-- Won once Lost once<br>VS Subaru 2.5RS(4wd)--- Won 3times<br>VS DMS(4wd)-- lost 2times won once<br>VS 89MustangGT--Won, but we both got ticket!!<br>VS Accord(V6&4cly)--never lost<br>VS Viper -- I didn't know when he stated!!<br>VS 911(non-turbo) ---Won 2times<br>VS 911(turbo) -- Same as Viper<br>VS Fiero SE --- it was really fun!!<br>VS Police car --- Lost manytimes Won 2times<p>By the way, 99 civic has same engine as CRX delsol(160hp), delsol cans run 1/4 mile in 15.4 @ ?miles.<p>Is 5spd good @ after 100mil on high way? what about top speed? Mine never go more than 125mil is this normal?(Sorry so long)
