Z||000026||Yellow85||06-07-99||10:15 PM||||Eric,<br>When i raced with 911,it was short race. i never raced with them up to 90mph range,but i'm sure FieroMike is telling truth.Well, power is not everything when it cames to race right? More power you have, more harder to control(especially 1st and 2nd gear).Anyway, i don't think i can beat them on the high way(with my fiero).By the way,i live in Seattle WA and i visit my friends in Vancouver BC Canada (you can find many cars and people who like to race) every weekend.<p>FieroMike,<br>It's nice to hear that you beaten Type-R(i wish i can beat them too)!!Do you have any idea to give higher top speed to my car(I mean something easy)? I'm still using fuctory coil, does it make big different when you change to MSD or etc...? It's really hard to race with import cars on the highway with lower top speed.<br>
