Z||000048||Cooter||06-17-99||10:07 PM||||I hope that I dont make all of you mad, but I have owned and driven lots of Fieros and other cars. I currently have an 85 SE and an 86 GT, along with my high performance 454 powered Suburban and my daily driver- the Honda Civic that seems to get a lot of abuse in this area. I would put the Civic up against the v6 fieros any day. I really like my fieros, but they just dont run like the Civic. Sorry, but if y'all are out running the hondas, somebody needs some help driving. I will tell my secret- launch at 6500 rpms, shift when the rev limiter kicks in at 7800 rpms and dont lift the gas until you are in fourth gear. It works very well for me, not so well for the other guys.
